{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">JUICE is a horror FPS told through two stories about the end of the world. Play as a hungry beast and a lone survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wreak havoc with swift, brutal combat, growing from a drooling larva to a colossal terror. At the same time, barricade your home and say goodbye to loved ones, trying to stay calm before it all collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy the city or cling to your last hope. Choose humanity's path!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><i>Features:</i></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast Gory Action</strong> <br>Mix quick shooter moves with fierce melee for stomach-turning mayhem.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hand Drawn World</strong><br>Spatter blood across a dark illustrated Noir city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Short but Intense</strong><br>Finish in a few sittings for a strong crunchy experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two Linked Storylines, Two Endings</strong><br>Save or ruin the world, it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Arcade Mode</strong><br>Hunt tasty humans in multiple arenas and stack up points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Metal Noisecore Soundtrack</strong><br>Hear your ears bleed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/extras/JUICE_trailer_store_07.gif?t=1741970730\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2844430?t=1741970730","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741970730","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741970730",